<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64595" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾰκεδνός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηκεδανός</span>
			, <i>tall, taper</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴγειρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					7.106
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλάται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					472
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάπαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					1273
				</span></i>
			: as pr. n. of the Dorians, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δωρικόν τε
				καὶ</span> M. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔθνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.43
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.56
			</span></i>; M. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκῦλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			 (who glosses it by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐράνια καὶ
				μεγάλα</span>).</div>
